{"title":"Career Roadmap: Logistics Executive","role":"Logistics Executive","summary":"A Logistics Executive coordinates the movement, storage and delivery of goods from suppliers to customers. The role connects procurement, inventory, warehouses, transportation, freight providers, suppliers, customers and finance teams.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com - Logistics & Supply Chain"},"about":[{"label":"Primary Goal","text":"Build expertise in transportation, warehousing, inventory, procurement, shipment coordination, documentation and supply-chain operations"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Roadmap Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"A Logistics Executive coordinates the movement, storage and delivery of goods from suppliers to customers. The role connects procurement, inventory, warehouses, transportation, freight providers, suppliers, customers and finance teams."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should understand the complete operational flow:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Supplier","Procurement","Inbound Logistics","Warehouse","Inventory","Order Processing","Transportation","Delivery","Returns"]},{"type":"p","text":"The role is increasingly technology-driven, so students should combine logistics knowledge + Excel + ERP + data analytics + supply-chain concepts."}]},{"heading":"What to Build During UG","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Learn From","Proof of Skill","Gap to Avoid"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Business & operations fundamentals"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, statistics"},{"text":"Basic operations case study"},{"text":"Weak quantitative skills"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Logistics fundamentals"},{"text":"Transportation, warehousing, inventory"},{"text":"Logistics process mapping"},{"text":"Learning only terminology"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Supply-chain operations"},{"text":"Procurement, ERP, analytics, distribution"},{"text":"Supply-chain dashboard"},{"text":"No practical exposure"}],[{"text":"Final Stage"},{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"Advanced Excel, ERP, internship"},{"text":"Logistics internship + capstone"},{"text":"Inability to analyze operational data"}]]}]},{"heading":"Semester-by-Semester Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Semester 1"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Accounting"},{"text":"Business Economics"},{"text":"Business Mathematics"},{"text":"Business Communication"},{"text":"Computer Applications"},{"text":"Excel fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 2"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business Statistics"},{"text":"Operations Management"},{"text":"Introduction to Logistics"},{"text":"Business Law"},{"text":"Inventory fundamentals"},{"text":"Supply-chain overview"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 3"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transportation Management"},{"text":"Warehousing"},{"text":"Inventory Management"},{"text":"Procurement fundamentals"},{"text":"Distribution Management"},{"text":"Logistics documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 4"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Freight Management"},{"text":"Shipping operations"},{"text":"Road/rail/air/sea logistics"},{"text":"Warehouse Management Systems"},{"text":"Packaging"},{"text":"Reverse logistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 5"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Supply Chain Management"},{"text":"Demand forecasting"},{"text":"Supply planning"},{"text":"ERP"},{"text":"SAP fundamentals"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Logistics analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Semester 6"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Logistics optimization"},{"text":"Procurement analytics"},{"text":"Route planning"},{"text":"Cost management"},{"text":"Supply-chain risk"},{"text":"Internship"},{"text":"Final logistics project"}]}]},{"heading":"Logistics Fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand the major logistics 